# Hard-Hitting Question's first target is the one that deals the damage. Bot2 destroys it in response (Get Lost on Hercules): it
# is no longer a legal target as the spell resolves (CR 608.2b) and cannot deal damage, though the other target is still
# legal - so Bot2's Ornithopter (power 0, toughness 2: any damage from the Question would be marked) is undamaged, and the
# Question still goes to the graveyard. Hercules is gone and Bot1 got Get Lost's two Map tokens.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Hercules, Prince of Power
Hard-Hitting Question
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Get Lost
Ornithopter
Island x16

